{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65dc26b91479222cc1981efb95199653c279def62e79e5d6714dfb33f48cdf2e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ed2335d036a817df54852b66f2dcc813d59b48b1608915984602a991c9d893a",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98c5c8b28814672c6d0b2ca45312a0039de4a459e3b9211c60e24a3b8b2d5f8d",
      "text": "我刚才看了前几天拍摄的电视剧的网络播出，\n正在回想拍摄当时的事情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47adc3ac05a1d0158cbd896147e25fd415d5204ff34822673ed0bb6d199314d3",
      "text": "里面也有动作戏，算是难度相当高的一场拍摄……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12c0899e5122aca18c1d6d8a1d1cd2e9ff3c91cd030f310ef6c8f489ea9e5cbe",
      "text": "承蒙您帮忙调整日程，在拍摄过程中也一直\n关照着我们，真的非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7316826b301909d3db48d9e7ba35b4e6d1b19791a04490c76745aba96873fc9e",
      "text": "能顺利完成拍摄，\n多亏了制作人的支持。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:925163315a3565746c38a0ae5b35eb8f3d8696f4403c036e5184650b1bba3c01",
      "text": "成了非常帅气的\n镜头呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d935c75af46308906341276f9b8b59fecea5988a896baa2a24b9622e2fcb04df",
      "text": "这是庄一郎先生他们\n努力的成果",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52c83013a0d7a3fede41ea4be345f3e348e6ecbffc68b26909322d65c6868b83",
      "text": "是的。呈现出了极具紧迫感的画面。\n我自己实际看了电视剧也很受触动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eadee54e2be53b464ee93dda2a0074a328e5130c656157b87b3fb131acf8368b",
      "text": "谢谢您。工作人员们，\n还有制作人……这是全体人员的成果呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2de7a36e39a1991005e2c5a57feddb396c18c810298ca0bec330b2bef7289f0f",
      "text": "听说因为是网络作品，观众当中\n也有不少资深的电视剧爱好者。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18e0587466f10bfdaa9b32216d822b4293f6c438657a0476f6cfd0350f2a40f3",
      "text": "那些人给出的评价似乎也很不错，\n努力总算没有白费。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a7f02b453443f6d378eb25f5166438f84f6e4d0ce2b5677140b7f173e2ed0d4",
      "text": "今后我也会努力做好工作，\n若是能得到您的支持，我将感到非常荣幸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:028soi_402_2_4_028_02_09_a:2_4_028_02_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12167fec623037b4532aafb11e8269bdcbfa7ebd3eafe68f2d1c71a662e8d0d4",
      "text": "那么，我差不多要进行下一项工作了，\n就先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
